  "notes": "The three-character floor removes nearly every two-character Chinese policy word (下调, 上调, 补贴, 减税, 禁令, 配额, 储备, 冻结, 放开, 收紧, 发放, 政策, 措施), so the lists are built from four-character verb-object phrases (免征关税, 解除禁令, 发放补贴, 启动预案) and from noun compounds that keep the same sense (进口关税, 最低收购价, 临时收储). 经济学 and 记者会 shaped the exclusions: nothing here is a substring of 经济学家, 记者会, 公司 or 医院. Agriculture-specific instruments such as 种粮补贴 and 农资补贴 were dropped because they embed subject nouns; 最低收购价 and 托市收购 are kept as they name only the mechanism."
